---
description: Investigate the user's skill issue with actual source and retained evidence, carrying any real semantic program review forward.
args:
  goal: string
  card: SkillMaintenanceCard
returns: SkillMaintenanceInquiry
---
Inspect the actual assigned working skill and its retained check. Distinguish the check's owning path/revision from the current working edition. When the requested diagnosis or repair needs a semantic contract review, compose authoring.reviewProgram with the actual observation.authoringRequest and retain the complete returned report, including its findings and revisions. Do not treat a compiling description as proof of semantic correctness, or let a semantic review override a real native regression. A focused inquiry may omit that review when it is unrelated to the requested finding. Return the actual card, observation and report or null for the caller's goal-aware continuation; do not write here.
